"Bevenn goulennoù miziek (%(limit)s) aet dreist evit ar profil %(name)r."

#: rules.py:54
#, python-format
msgid "Daily budget (%(budget)s USD) exceeded for profile %(name)r."
msgstr ""
"Budjed pemdeziek (%(budget)s USD) aet dreist evit ar profil %(name)r."

#: rules.py:61
#, python-format
msgid "Monthly budget (%(budget)s USD) exceeded for profile %(name)r."
msgstr ""
"Budjed miziek (%(budget)s USD) aet dreist evit ar profil %(name)r."

#: rules.py:69
#, python-format
msgid "Model %(model_id)r is disabled."
msgstr "Diweredekaet eo ar model %(model_id)r."

#: rules.py:72
#, python-format
msgid "Profile %(name)r allows only free models; %(model_id)r is not free."
msgstr ""
"Ne aotren ar profil %(name)r nemet ar modelloù digoust; n'eo ket digoust "
